Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Teamwork
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 20
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.25,0:00:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, these are the flowers you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, you’re awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be nervous; it’s just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t look too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some water first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.46,0:00:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything I can do to help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re going to head off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.61,0:01:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Weslie, she’s been really good to me lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s find a way to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.24,0:01:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t abandon her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s safe here; let’s leave her here for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll go into town and find someone to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.75,0:01:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go; just leave her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.31,0:01:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In your condition, you really ought to get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.50,0:01:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll go into town and find a way to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.41,0:01:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We told you to get some proper rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we’re even more worried about leaving you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop putting on an act. I’m not letting you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.56,0:01:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so? Then come along with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.40,0:01:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei, let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.59,0:02:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right—here’s your doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.07,0:02:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Brother Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get this doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Big Sister is hurt, the doll must be worried about her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.05,0:02:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how she’s doing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. Because that Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.45,0:02:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,has been following us all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about taking her away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.92,0:02:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you followed us after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.51,0:02:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think you can make it out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.75,0:02:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is full of treacherous quicksand and elusive sandsharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a vehicle or a guide,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.94,0:02:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,there is absolutely no way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.54,0:02:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,you’ll get out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to wait for you to run into trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can take her away without lifting a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.13,0:03:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If we really do run into the situation you described,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt you can make it out of the desert right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.61,0:03:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.97,0:03:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve been affected by the miasma; you’ll likely collapse before we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.56,0:03:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You never hurt Xiao Mei, so I don’t think you’re a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t we work together to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it. I have no need for cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.67,0:03:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooperation is just mutual exploitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever actually cooperated with anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.70,0:03:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t think you understand the rules of survival here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In this world where resources are scarce,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.90,0:03:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,everything is a transaction with a price tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the way I see it, collaboration
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.65,0:03:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,is a good thing where we learn from each other and grow together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:03:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer are you going to sleep? Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remember it was total chaos, and then we fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and it was such a comfortable sleep, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s been ages since I slept this well; I feel so refreshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you’re awake, figure out how to clean up this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.14,0:04:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected Cha Erlang to pull a fast one on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.06,0:04:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are we still going to capture Blue Scarf and that little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.94,0:04:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole Blue Planet knows Blue Scarf is injured now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the perfect time to catch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we have nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether it’s the little girl or Blue Scarf,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.45,0:04:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,catching just one of them means an endless supply of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.24,0:04:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to catch both of them before Cha Erlang does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Split up and search.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.51,0:04:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine. Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Planet Broadcast:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.19,0:04:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Word is out that Blue Scarf is incapacitated due to injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the perfect time to catch them—let’s go, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How did the news spread so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re the target of everyone’s hostility right now; you can’t handle this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.01,0:05:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn’t I be able to handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.65,0:05:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the state you’re in—why are you still trying to act cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Weslie…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.01,0:05:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t need you to interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.97,0:05:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.61,0:05:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you love meddling in other people’s business so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.85,0:05:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I don’t need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you stop arguing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won’t need it in the future, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If I say I don’t need it, I don’t need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s simply impossible to communicate with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei, let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Cha Erlang’s gear here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop shooting—friendly forces here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it wrapped so tightly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay, thanks for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.41,0:06:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I need to help Boss get his gear, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.53,0:06:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, I brought my gear bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.52,0:06:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,See if there’s anything suitable; I’ll go chase it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see what you brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Banana
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.75,0:06:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you need a full stomach to have the energy to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t there anything actually useful?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s everything I own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and give back the Boss’s gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, something decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.37,0:07:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad it’s too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.27,0:07:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It might come in handy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Come help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.67,0:07:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a real struggle finding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.26,0:07:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys don’t look like you’re doing too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here. Take one more step, and don’t blame me for what happens next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it you’ve lost your ability to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.01,0:07:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you prove to me whether that’s true or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you really were affected by the miasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s nothing to fear, everyone—attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.04,0:08:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re about to get our hands on a huge amount of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m running out of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.47,0:08:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull me up; I’ll help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand me your line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What? There’s another Sand Shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.87,0:08:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m Weslie from Green Green Grassland.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.23,0:08:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve still got medicine on my eyes; I can’t fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.71,0:09:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, I’ll remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.78,0:09:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,See? We do need to work together after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My skateboard is running out of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.77,0:09:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just grab onto it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, where’s the monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t help Boss anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Here’s the gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.07,0:10:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren’t hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei, why did you go over to the quicksand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.10,0:10:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was because…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.26,0:10:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.93,0:10:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry. I just didn’t want you two to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.73,0:10:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn’t know how to stop the argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.29,0:10:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you liked this flower, Big Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.45,0:10:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so I wanted to give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, you wouldn’t fight with Brother Weslie anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and you could discuss things calmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:10:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry for holding everyone back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:10:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.44,0:11:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It was when I saw Big Sister’s scarf while I was sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.87,0:11:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.14,0:11:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the collaboration we discussed earlier still on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.22,0:11:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.65,0:11:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then—you help me find the antidote,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.69,0:11:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and I’ll take you to your destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.44,0:11:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wear this flower, it means we’re collaborating too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.63,0:11:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So, no more fighting with Brother Weslie from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.51,0:11:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The kids and I will keep an eye on Big Sister and Brother Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:11:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You look really nice when you smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.02,0:12:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I didn’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.77,0:12:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You look really nice when you blush, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.25,0:12:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep saying that and I won’t be so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.37,0:12:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s nothing wrong with mentioning that you’re blushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.01,0:12:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run away.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
